          "quote": "(net (name \"VREF+_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"13\") (pinfunction \"PH1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"HSE_IN_NAVC\") ... (node (ref \"HSE2\") (pin \"1\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"HSE_OUT_NAVC\") ... (node (ref \"R32\") (pin \"1\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU has the specified crystal connected to its oscillator pins. The FCC crystal is routed to GPIO pins, while the NAVC crystal is isolated from the MCU; operation requiring the intended external clock may fail or use an unintended clock source.",
      "confidence": 0.98
